# Git

## Ignore Node.js dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## Ignore environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

## Ignore build outputs
dist/
build/
.next/
out/

## Ignore logs and runtime files
logs/
*.log
.pid
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

## Ignore OS files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

## Ignore IDE files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
